---
import Digi from '../layouts/Digi.astro';
const services = [
{code:'DEFEND', title:'Cybersecurity', text:'Find the gaps. Strengthen your defenses. Protect the systems your business depends on.', items:['Threat detection & prevention','Endpoint & network security','Penetration testing & security audits','Data encryption & privacy'], id:'cybersecurity'},
{code:'BUILD', title:'Software development', text:'Purpose-built software for the way you work, with security considered from the first decision.', items:['Website development','Mobile applications','Desktop applications','Solutions tailored to your business'], id:'software'},
{code:'ENABLE', title:'Training & awareness', text:'Technology is only part of the picture. Give your people the knowledge to make better decisions.', items:['Cybersecurity awareness','Software development training','Security best practices','Tailored team training'], id:'training'}
];
---
<Digi>
<div class="security-story"><section class="hero">
<div class="hero-copy"><p class="meta"><span class="status-dot"></span> YOUR DIGITAL FUTURE. PROTECTED.</p><h1>Secure your<br/>world.<br/><span class="muted-title">Build what’s</span><br/><span class="muted-title">next.</span></h1><p class="hero-lead">Cybersecurity. Software. Human expertise.<br/>A complete perspective on your digital world.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#services">Explore our expertise <span>↘</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Talk to an expert <span>↗</span></a></div></div>
<div class="hero-art"><div id="security-core" aria-label="Exploded security enclosure revealing connected endpoints, servers, firewall layers and an identity lock" role="img"><svg class="core-fallback" viewBox="0 0 600 600" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="metal"><stop stop-color="#edf4ff"/><stop offset=".45" stop-color="#516d91"/><stop offset=".7" stop-color="#b4d2f0"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#17263d"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill="none" stroke="url(#metal)"><ellipse cx="300" cy="300" rx="230" ry="110" stroke-width="22" transform="rotate(-35 300 300)"/><ellipse cx="300" cy="300" rx="230" ry="110" stroke-width="14" transform="rotate(55 300 300)"/><circle cx="300" cy="300" r="180" stroke-width="6"/></g><path d="M300 185 385 220v85q0 65-85 110-85-45-85-110v-85z" fill="url(#metal)"/><path d="m267 297 24 25 48-56" fill="none" stroke="#b4e3ef" stroke-width="9"/></svg></div><div class="art-label art-label-top"><span class="cross">+</span> DEFENSE IN EVERY DIRECTION</div><div class="art-label art-label-side">360°<small>A COMPLETE PERSPECTIVE</small></div><div class="art-caption"><span class="status-dot"></span><span>YOUR BUSINESS AT THE CORE</span><button id="motion-toggle" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Pause 3D animation">Ⅱ</button></div></div>
<div class="hero-bottom"><a href="#approach">SCROLL TO EXPLORE <span>↓</span></a><span>SECURITY IS A CONTINUOUS PROCESS.</span><span>DIGIINN360</span></div>
</section>
<div class="security-chapters">
<article class="security-chapter"><p class="section-kicker">01 / DISCOVER</p><h2>Reveal what matters.</h2><p>The enclosure opens to reveal your connected world: applications, endpoints and the data at its center. Security starts by knowing what is inside.</p><div class="story-code">ASSESS</div></article><article class="security-chapter"><p class="section-kicker">02 / TEST</p><h2>Find the weak link.</h2><p>One exposed endpoint can put the wider network at risk. Testing and audits help locate the gaps before an attacker reaches your critical systems.</p><div class="story-code">INSPECT</div></article><article class="security-chapter"><p class="section-kicker">03 / PROTECT</p><h2>Stop the path to impact.</h2><p>Watch the protective layers slide into place. Network defense and endpoint controls interrupt the threat’s route to the systems behind them.</p><div class="story-code">DEFEND</div></article><article class="security-chapter"><p class="section-kicker">04 / ENABLE</p><h2>Verify. Then trust.</h2><p>The identity lock closes as the exposed connection is secured. Access management and informed people help keep the right doors open and the wrong ones closed.</p><div class="story-code">ENABLE</div></article><article class="security-chapter"><p class="section-kicker">05 / EVOLVE</p><h2>Protection, built in.</h2><p>The enclosure comes together around a strengthened system. Secure development, layered protection and practical training work as one.</p><div class="story-code">360°</div></article>
</div></div>
<section class="expertise-strip" aria-label="Expertise overview"><a href="#cybersecurity"><span>PROTECT</span>Cybersecurity <b>↗</b></a><a href="#software"><span>CREATE</span>Software development <b>↗</b></a><a href="#training"><span>EMPOWER</span>Training & awareness <b>↗</b></a></section>
<section class="intro paper" id="approach"><div class="section-kicker">THE 360° PERSPECTIVE</div><h2>Progress needs<br/><span>a secure foundation.</span></h2><div class="intro-bottom"><div class="orbit-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎<span>360</span></div><p>Your systems, your software, your people. They’re connected. Your security should be, too.</p><div><p>We bring cybersecurity, software development and practical training together to help you move forward with confidence.</p><a class="text-link dark-link" href="/about/">Meet DigiInn360 <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="services paper" id="services"><div class="section-head"><p class="section-kicker">OUR EXPERTISE</p><h2>Three disciplines.<br/>One stronger business.</h2></div>{services.map(s=><article class="service-row" id={s.id}><div class="flap-code">{s.code.split('').map(l=><span>{l}</span>)}</div><div><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.text}</p><a class="text-link dark-link" href={`/services/#${s.id}`}>Explore {s.title.toLowerCase()} <span>↗</span></a></div><ul>{s.items.map(i=><li>{i}</li>)}</ul></article>)}</section>
<section class="process"><div class="process-heading"><p class="section-kicker">BUILT AROUND YOUR BUSINESS</p><h2>See the whole picture.<br/><span>Act where it matters.</span></h2><p>Good security starts with understanding what you need to protect. Here’s how we approach it.</p><a class="button" href="#contact">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="process-steps">{[['01','Understand','Your operations. Your systems. Your priorities. We start with the context behind the technology.'],['02','Strengthen','Identify vulnerabilities, put the right controls in place and build solutions around your needs.'],['03','Stay ready','Support your people with training and keep security part of the everyday conversation.']].map(s=><div><span>{s[0]}</span><h3>{s[1]}</h3><p>{s[2]}</p></div>)}</div></section>
<section class="faq paper"><p class="section-kicker">A LITTLE CLARITY</p><h2>Let’s make security<br/>less complicated.</h2><div class="faq-list">{[['Where should we start with cybersecurity?','Start with what matters most: your critical systems, sensitive data and the people who use them. Talk to us about your current setup so we can discuss the right next steps.'],['Can you help us build software as well?','Yes. DigiInn360 develops websites, mobile applications and desktop software tailored to business needs. We can discuss development and cybersecurity together.'],['Do you offer training for our team?','Yes. We offer security awareness and software development training, including programs tailored to your team. Contact us to discuss the audience, topics and format.']].map(f=><details><summary>{f[0]}<span>+</span></summary><p>{f[1]}</p></details>)}</div></section>
<section class="contact" id="contact"><p class="section-kicker">LET’S START WITH A CONVERSATION</p><h2>What’s next<br/>for your business<span>?</span></h2><div class="contact-bottom"><a class="button" href="mailto:info@digiinn360.com?subject=Let%E2%80%99s%20talk%20about%20our%20digital%20future">Email our team <span>↗</span></a><div><span>EMAIL US</span><a href="mailto:info@digiinn360.com">info@digiinn360.com ↗</a></div><div><span>CALL US</span><a href="tel:+92512748690">+92 51 2748690 ↗</a><a href="tel:+923095624742">+92 309 5624742 ↗</a></div></div></section>
<script>if (!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) import('../motion/security-core').then(({initCore}) => initCore());</script>
</Digi>


